{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年33歲的日本前AV女優濱崎真緒引退後，移居香港發展，並以「DJ Mao」身份在亞洲各地做DJ工作。</p><p>她剛於萬聖節（10月31日）夜赴尖沙咀酒吧演出期間，懷疑遭到有心人士於飲品中「落藥」。</p><p>事發後她因全身抽搐僵硬被緊急送往伊利沙伯醫院，院方檢</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T10:42:17.572340+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T09:43:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.826767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T10:38:18.826767+00:00","content_hash":"91c3c0505dd7532f45331dc809c0e399b5a6115e85d62342cad8a471dff09d5f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}